Biascor files include light curve fit parameters and
sim-truth values for large (~1million) simulations of
DES+LOWz SNe.

We provide simulations using 2 methods of modeling
intrinsic scatter of SNeIa luminosities, based on
G10: Guy et al. 2010  and C11: Conley et al. 2011.

Sims are generated on a 2x2 grid of
alpha and beta values:

The alpha grid is 0.10 to 0.24 for both G10 and C11.
The beta grid is 2.7 to 3.5 for G10;
the beta grid is 3.3 to 4.3 for C11.

We provid one large simulation for each
intrinsic scatter model, G10 and C11.

Column definitions in ASCII table:

CID              # candidate ID 
IDSURVEY         # integer SURVEY ID (DES:10, CFA3:63-64, CFA4:65-66-67, CSP:68)
TYPE             # SN type (always 1 for DES-SN3YR sims)
FIELD            # NULL for low-z, set to SN field name for DES
CUTFLAG_SNANA    # always=1 since all events here pass cuts
zHEL             # heliocentric redshift
zHELERR          # error on above
zCMB             # CMB redshift
zCMBERR          # error on above
zHD              # Hubble diagram redshift; zCMB with VPEC correction
zHDERR           # error on above: zCMBERR + VPECERR
VPEC             # pec velocity correction applied to ZHD
VPECERR          # error on above
HOST_LOGMASS     # log10(Mstellar/Msun)
HOST_LOGMASS_ERR # error on above
SNRMAX1          # max SNR among all observations
SNRMAX2          # max SNR after removing band with SNRMAX1
SNRMAX3          # max SNR after removing bands with SNRMAX1 and SNRMAX2
PKMJD            # best fit peak-MJD (rest-frame B band) from SALT2 light curve fit
PKMJDERR         # error on above
x1               # best fit SALT2 stretch parameter
x1ERR            # error on above
c                # best fit SALT2 color parameter
cERR             # error on above
mB               # -2.5log10(x0), where x0 is defined below
mBERR            # error on mB
x0               # best fit SALT2 amplitude
x0ERR            # error on above
COV_x1_c         # fitted covariance bertween x1 and c
COV_x1_x0        # fitted covariance bertween x1 and x0
COV_c_x0         # fitted covariance bertween c and x0
NDOF             # number of degrees of freedom in light curve fit
FITCHI2          # total CHI2 from light curve fit
FITPROB          # fit probabilit [0-1] for CHI2 and NDOF
SIM_TYPE_INDEX       # always 1 for DES-SN3YR (no CC contamination)
SIM_TEMPLATE_INDEX   # always 0 for DES-SN3YR (no CC contamination)
SIM_LIBID            # observation library entry ID
SIM_NGEN_LIBID       # not used
SIM_ZCMB             # true CMB redshift
SIM_VPEC             # true peculiar velocity
SIM_DLMAG            # true distance modulus
SIM_PKMJD            # true MJD of peak-mag (rest-frame B band)
SIM_x1               # true SALT2 x1 value
SIM_c                # true SALT2 c value
SIM_alpha            # true SALT2 alpha value
SIM_beta             # true SALT2 beta value
SIM_x0               # true SALT2 x0 value
SIM_mB               # true SALT2 mB value
SIM_AV               # true host-galaxy extinction (always -9 => not used)
